  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: [( 48 - 2) ÷ 23] × 19 + 3 = ?\n\nAfter ‘÷’ and ‘-’ are interchanged and ‘×’ and ‘+’ are interchanged then,\n\n[( 48 - 2) ÷ 23] × 19 + 3 = ? ⇒ [( 48 ÷ 2) - 23] + 19 × 3 = ?\n\n⇒ [__**( 48 **____**÷**____** 2)**__ - 23] + 19 × 3 = ?\n\n⇒ __**[24**____** - 23]**__ + 19 × 3 = ?\n\n⇒ 1 + __**19 × 3**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**1 **____**+ 57**__ = ?\n\n⇒ **58 = ?**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
